graph TD
    A[Start Day] --> B(GroupManager: Cluster Agents)

    subgraph Creator Phase
    B --> C1[Group: Compliance Creators]
    B --> C2[Group: Watermark Breakers]
    C1 --> D1{LLM: Macro Policy}
    C2 --> D2{LLM: Macro Policy}
    D1 & D2 --> E[Python: Micro Execution]
    E -- Generate --> F[(Vector DB: Content Store)]
    end

    subgraph Public Phase
    F -- Recommendation (Sim + Time + Social) --> G[Python: Individual Feeds]
    B --> H[Group: Rebel Public]
    B --> I[Group: Trust Public]
    H --> J1{LLM: Reaction Rules}
    I --> J2{LLM: Reaction Rules}
    G & J1 & J2 --> K[Python: Match Rules & Update Stats]
    end

    subgraph Platform Phase
    K --> L[Calc: Cost & Pressure]
    L --> M{LLM: Adjust Theta}
    end